{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33697","headline":"和周繇校书先辈省中寓直 · 林宽","name":"和周繇校书先辈省中寓直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古木重门掩，幽深秖欠溪。\n此中真吏隐，何必更岩栖。\n名姓镌幢记，经书逐库题。\n字随飞蠹缺，堦与落星齐。\n伴直僧谈静，侵霜蛩韵低。\n粘尘贺草没，剥粉薛禽迷。\n衰藓墙千堵，微阳菊半畦。\n鼓残鸦去北，漏在月沈西。\n每忆终南雪，几登云阁梯。\n时因搜句次，那惜一招携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}